  "description": "Reid Ladies Classic V2 eBike | Vintage electric commuter bike\nTimeless vintage styling meets modern electric performance – a stylish and comfortable eBike for everyday commutes, city journeys and leisurely rides along scenic pathways.\nThe Reid Bikes Ladies Classic V2 eBike combines a lightweight alloy frame with a concealed 352Wh battery and 250W rear hub motor, delivering smooth electric assistance with a clean, refined finish. Internal cable routing complements its classic silhouette, blending traditional design with modern eBike technology.\nThe Ananda D19 handlebar-mounted display features Bluetooth connectivity, providing clear ride information and app compatibility. A 7-speed drivetrain, featuring an L-TWOO trigger shifter and Shimano rear derailleur, offers versatile gearing for tackling varied routes. Tektro hydraulic disc brakes provide reliable stopping power and control, while wide 700x45c commuter tyres enhance stability and comfort across everyday surfaces.\nDesigned with comfort and style in mind, the Reid Bikes Ladies Classic V2 features a comfortable saddle, brown leather grips and classic-shaped alloy handlebars with a quill stem for a relaxed, upright riding position. A steel fork and alloy platform pedals complete the vintage-inspired design, making it a practical and elegant choice for everyday cycling.\nCombining understated style, modern connectivity and dependable electric assistance, the Reid Bikes Ladies Classic V2 eBike makes everyday journeys more comfortable and enjoyable. From commuting around town to exploring scenic routes, it offers a distinctive alternative to conventional transport.\nThe Reid Bikes Ladies Classic V2 eBike is ideal for:\n\nEveryday commuters, looking for electric assistance to make journeys around town easier\n\nVintage bike enthusiasts, combining classic styling with modern eBike technology\n\nComfort-focused riders, with an upright riding position, comfortable saddle and wide commuter tyres\n\nUrban and leisure cycling, suited to city streets and scenic pathways\n\nRiders tackling varied routes, with 7-speed gearing to adapt to changing terrain\n\nRiders seeking confident braking, with Tektro hydraulic disc brakes for reliable stopping power\n\nConnected cyclists, with a Bluetooth-enabled Ananda D19 display and app compatibility\n\nStyle-conscious riders, with a concealed battery, internal cable routing and refined vintage details",
